AVSG release licensing
======================

Dataset annotations and documentation
-------------------------------------
AVSG scene graphs, attributes, anonymized validation/audit judgments, and
accompanying dataset documentation retain the existing annotation terms:
CC BY-NC 4.0 with the additional use restriction stated in data/LICENSE.
That file is retained verbatim from the verified dataset release and includes
the source-data provenance.

Software
--------
A separate software license has not yet been specified by the authors.
The annotation license above does not apply to the source code. This release
does not introduce an MIT, Apache, or other blanket software license.

Third-party material
--------------------
Source videos, LongVALE captions and clip boundaries, model weights, external
libraries, and model reference implementations retain their respective terms.
Model predictions are provided for reproduction of the reported evaluation.
Model weights and source video files are not distributed in this repository.
